Bipyramid, square-pyramid, interior holomorphic stabilizer orders: 6 4 2
Exact family: infinity,-i*r,i*r,-1,1 ; 1/sqrt(3) <= r <= 1
Quartic parameter: mu=i*(r-1/r); endpoints -2i/sqrt(3),0
Quartic discriminant: 16*(nu - 2)**2*(nu + 2)**2
Finite f_B,s incidence: 20 source objects,30 targets,60 arrows; valencies3,2
The parameter mu=0 is nonsingular and gives the square-pyramidal configuration.
